@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam stateBorderColor #4A6FA5
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
title OffDelay (pregunta 6): enabled es true en Active y Holding

[*] --> Idle
Idle --> Active : request && !stop
Active --> Holding : !request
Active --> Idle : stop
Holding --> Active : request
Holding --> Idle : stop || age >= delay
note "Holding vence aunque las entradas sean desconocidas.\nParo sano o retardo no válido: cualquier fase -> Idle." as N
@enduml
